            <div xml:id="d321">

                <pb facs="0460" n="448" sameAs="frus:frus1945v05/pg448"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.248/3–645: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Portugal</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Crocker</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-03-24T12:00:00-04:00">March 24,
                            1945—noon.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>471. The draft ATC agreement modified as indicated in your 510, March 6,<anchor
                        n="26" xml:id="d321-f1"/> and with the substituted article 2 quoted in urtel
                    630, March 22, is acceptable to the Department, ATC, and War Department. You are
                    hereby authorized to conclude negotiations by an exchange of notes.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
